  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供结构化日志记录能力，支持多级别日志（trace/debug/info/warn/error）、文件输出、日志轮转、格式自定义、运行时级别动态调整等功能。",
    "en-US": "Structured logging with multi-level support (trace/debug/info/warn/error), file output, log rotation, custom formatting, and runtime level adjustment."
  },
